x's eyes started going  misty watering up as he gasped for air  still feeling that lingering feeling of  being held right at the edge of being  sick in a final act of desperation he  jammed his fingers down his throat  trying to dislodge or dispel whatever  was making him gag that's when he felt  it a cluster of little solid pieces  embedded in the roof of his mouth  teeth that hadn't been there before  hadn't grown naturally but had just  sprung out of his flesh and more were  growing pain filled his mouth spreading  over alex's entire face as new jagged  teeth came bursting through his gum line  overlapping with his natural set tearing  his jaw into a wide crooked grin looking  up through his tear-filled eyes he could  see the same uneven smile on the face of  the grinner as  scp-4910 began dashing towards its next  prey  now go and check out  scp-323 the wendigo skull and scp-2086  man eating bus if you dare to learn more  about even more malicious monstrosities  carnivorous creatures and atrocious  anomalies that all seek to do harm to  humans

