urned to look in the same  direction and there it was only a few  feet away under the light of a street  lamp it was almost like  scp-4910 was waiting for them to catch  their breath intelligent enough to know  its hunt wasn't yet over alex having now  finally gotten a better look at the  monster instantly wished he hadn't it  made him feel sick like there was a lump  lodged in the back of his throat the  grinner stood atop four pink sinnohy  legs its body just a formless mass of  pure musculature that looked like it had  been sculpted out of the same tissue  that human gums are made from it lacked  a neck instead having a pair of massive  jaws poking out between its front  shoulders a dark marble-like eye on  either side of its head as  cp-4910's wide almost crocodilian jaws  parted showing off what had earned it  the ironic nickname of the grinner it  presented a gaping maw of crooked uneven  teeth with more clusters of enamel  protruding from its back elbows and head  these teeth even formed the hooves it  walked on at this distance it was hard  to tell if the sickening yellow coloring  of the teeth was purely because of the  street lights or that they had been  stained and covered in plaque alex tried  to contain a cough in his throat his  stomach feeling like it was folding over  itself at the sickening site of scp-4910  he started spluttering wondering if he  was about to vomit given the lingering  feeling at the back of his throat like  the sensation one gets when something is  forcing its way up the esophagus but it  was lodged the feeling wasn't coming up  and out of alex's throat it was stuck  there by now he was wheezing desperately  trying to breathe through relentless  coughs jones kept his eyes on the  creature he was pacing slowly towards  them now keeping a distance but moving  like a lion encircling its prey warren  turned and kneeled down to alex slapping  him hard on the back trying to help him  cough up whatever he was practically  choking on alex's eyes started going  misty watering up as he gasped for air  still feeling that lingering feeling of  being held right at the edge of being  sick in a final act of desperation he  jammed his fingers down his throat  trying to dislodge or dispel whatever  was making him gag that's when he felt  it a cluster of little solid pieces  embedded in the roof of his mouth  teeth that hadn't been there before  hadn't grown naturally but had just  sprung out of his flesh and more were  growing pain filled his mouth spreading  over alex's entire face as new jagged  teeth came bursting through his gum line  overlapping with his natural set tearing  his jaw into a wide crooked grin looking  up through his tear-filled eyes he could  see the same uneven smile on the face of  the grinner as  scp-4910 began dashing towards its next  prey  now go and check out  scp-323 the wendigo skull and scp-2086  man eating bus if you dare to learn more  about even more malicious monstrosities  carnivorous creatures and atrocious  anomalies that all seek to do harm to  humans
 

